{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodletter is a strategic deck-builder where cunning and craft are needed to vanquish evil. A deck-builder most strategic, its roots lie entwined with the arcane art of tarot, remedies of the flesh, and the surrounding superstitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil entities have crept into the hearts of the common folk, who teeter upon the brink of madness and death. Only thy bathhouse stands as a bastion against the creeping corruption.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will thy dubious methods offer them salvation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/e31dd63ecfff9b667b78e59fd6ab6086.poster.avif?t=1761586847\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/e31dd63ecfff9b667b78e59fd6ab6086.webm?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/e31dd63ecfff9b667b78e59fd6ab6086.mp4?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As moonlight falleth, malevolent spirits stir. Take up the mantle of a barber-surgeon and protect the villagers from their vile influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/9e12b63192479ac595b294c97948af29.poster.avif?t=1761586847\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/9e12b63192479ac595b294c97948af29.webm?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/9e12b63192479ac595b294c97948af29.mp4?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use thy deck of cards to heal villagers' bodies and minds from the entities\u2019 attacks and ready them for another cursed night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/4ac49d99868d38f8945ae34d26c7fdec.poster.avif?t=1761586847\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/4ac49d99868d38f8945ae34d26c7fdec.webm?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/4ac49d99868d38f8945ae34d26c7fdec.mp4?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In exchange for thy help, villagers offer strange new arts and powerful boons \u2014 but beware: trust, once broken, shall not be mended easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>GAME FEATURES:\u00a0</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 cards bearing unique incantations, illustrations and titles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 blessing and curse cards capable of turning fate itself upon its head</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 villagers with their own talents, oddities, and eerie animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 dreadful entities, each a foul spirit with its own wicked design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 fantastical realm, steeped in medieval myth, mystery, and dread</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take heed, barber-surgeon: the path of the bloodletter is not for the faint of heart \u2014 salvation or damnation await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493400?t=1761586847","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493400?t=1761586847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/57acfdc9863a2f093f4be770e616012f691947fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761586847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/57acfdc9863a2f093f4be770e616012f691947fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761586847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Bloodletter is a game heavily inspired by the healing methods of the medieval times. Thus a lot of the cards illustrations and overaching themes within the game are tied to this and showcase an overall dark atmosphere. Cruelties of the times that were regarded as healing methods like for example bloodletting and trepanation can be found on the cards, in the opening cinematic and in some UI illustrations."},"demos":[{"appid":3548560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodletter is a strategic deck-builder where cunning and craft are needed to vanquish evil. A deck-builder most strategic, its roots lie entwined with the arcane art of tarot, remedies of the flesh, and the surrounding superstitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil entities have crept into the hearts of the common folk, who teeter upon the brink of madness and death. Only thy bathhouse stands as a bastion against the creeping corruption.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will thy dubious methods offer them salvation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/e31dd63ecfff9b667b78e59fd6ab6086.poster.avif?t=1761586847\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/e31dd63ecfff9b667b78e59fd6ab6086.webm?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/e31dd63ecfff9b667b78e59fd6ab6086.mp4?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As moonlight falleth, malevolent spirits stir. Take up the mantle of a barber-surgeon and protect the villagers from their vile influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/9e12b63192479ac595b294c97948af29.poster.avif?t=1761586847\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/9e12b63192479ac595b294c97948af29.webm?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/9e12b63192479ac595b294c97948af29.mp4?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use thy deck of cards to heal villagers' bodies and minds from the entities\u2019 attacks and ready them for another cursed night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/4ac49d99868d38f8945ae34d26c7fdec.poster.avif?t=1761586847\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/4ac49d99868d38f8945ae34d26c7fdec.webm?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/extras/4ac49d99868d38f8945ae34d26c7fdec.mp4?t=1761586847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In exchange for thy help, villagers offer strange new arts and powerful boons \u2014 but beware: trust, once broken, shall not be mended easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>GAME FEATURES:\u00a0</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 cards bearing unique incantations, illustrations and titles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 blessing and curse cards capable of turning fate itself upon its head</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 villagers with their own talents, oddities, and eerie animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 dreadful entities, each a foul spirit with its own wicked design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 fantastical realm, steeped in medieval myth, mystery, and dread</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take heed, barber-surgeon: the path of the bloodletter is not for the faint of heart \u2014 salvation or damnation await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ALDAMAMI GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493400/header.jpg?t=1761586847","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3493400/158182775/0fabf7970aaa31251b349db0914de23e15a4f40f/1761228672/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761229521","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3493400/158182775/0fabf7970aaa31251b349db0914de23e15a4f40f/1761228672/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761229521","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3493400/158182775